<title>USA: NORTH CAROLINA EASTERN MUNI POWER AGENCY REPRICED,.</title>
<headline>NORTH CAROLINA EASTERN MUNI POWER AGENCY REPRICED,.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc said Tuesday it repriced a $446 million North Carolina Eastern Municipal Power Agency refunding system revenue bond issue, refunding Series 1996A and B, cutting the maximum yields in 2024 to 5.90 percent and in 2021 in 5.93 percent.</p>
</text>
